{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 90,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I was 16, I was\nfocusing on becoming"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3510,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a good open source developer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5340,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I love the fact that I'm\nstill working on something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7590,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was passionate about as a teenager,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9750,
    "dDurationMs": 2274,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I think this is\ngonna be my life mission."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12024,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(calm music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15720,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Replit is the place where\nyou go with an idea in mind,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18810,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "no coding skills whatsoever,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20700,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "expressing in natural language\nwhat you want to build,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23370,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then they see the\nmagic for the first time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26070,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We made coding so accessible to everyone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29460,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They don't even feel that\nthey're writing code anymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31590,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're just creating an\nidea they have in their mind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34050,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and turning it into one application,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35880,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "turning it into a website."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37350,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So when you started\nbuilding the Replit agent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39960,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you were experimenting\nwith different models,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42150,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why did you land on using Claude?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44490,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We need high IQ level in our agent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48180,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I love to use this analogy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49440,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where models are like the car engine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51420,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we're building the entire\ncar around it ourselves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54870,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In order for us to remove the\nbarrier of entry of coding,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58320,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the power of the model is\nwhat makes the difference."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61350,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We made a choice back in early 2024,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64290,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where Sonnet 3.5 came out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66960,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and since then, Anthropic\nkept the lead in having"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69840,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the best coding models on the market."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72090,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So one of my favorite parts of my job"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74340,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in applied AI is when we work with you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76860,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on early research previews\nof our newest models."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79890,
    "dDurationMs": 3829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It feels like receiving\na shiny toy at Christmas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83719,
    "dDurationMs": 971,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(both laughing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84690,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The discovery process of finding out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86820,
    "dDurationMs": 3483,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what it's capable to do is the\nmost exciting window of time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91470,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Early 2025, you gave us\naccess to Sonnet 3.7."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95520,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We rushed to create Replit Agent V2,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98310,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the moment Anthropic\nlaunched the new model"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101040,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we launched it in the same day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102690,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "our new agent, there was a\nincredible marketing pop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106710,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And this is something that's used"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107910,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by relatively few people at the moment?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109770,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's kind of a hidden secret or?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112500,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I think we recently crossed\n40 million registered users."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115380,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We got a lot of attention\nbecause users experienced"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118350,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "something that they've never\nseen before in our product."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121920,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Hannah] So what makes Replit unique?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124110,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We remove all the complexity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126030,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that makes the job of a\nsoftware engineer really hard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129090,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That barrier has been\ncompletely crushed by Replit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131730,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm approached by people\nthat didn't even feel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134730,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the permission to create\nsoftware in their life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137130,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They always had like an\namazing business idea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139290,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, they're doing the zero\nto one complete in Replit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143503,
    "dDurationMs": 2199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is changing people's lives."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145702,
    "dDurationMs": 2667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(upbeat music)"
    } ]
  } ]
}
